function bug() {
  echo "<a href=\"https://github.com/mvysny/aedict/issues/$1\">bug #$1</a>"
}

export TITLE="Change Log"

export CONTENT='''

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.50.13</h2>
<p>5. March, 2019</p>
<ul>
<li>Optionally remove html tags from search string '''$(bug 867)'''</li>
<li>Fixed crash when trying to search for specific string</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.50.12</h2>
<p>4. March, 2019</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed sync crash on Androids 19 and lower</li>
<li>Fixed crash when trying to search with small yu</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.50.11</h2>
<p>1. March, 2019</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: Sentence analysis incorrectly splits verb+suru '''$(bug 856)'''</li>
<li>Added: You can now add links to AnkiDroid or to your webpage such as <a href="aedict://はは">aedict://はは</a>,
<a href="aedict://はは%20は">aedict://はは%20は</a>, <a href="aedict://a?q=はは%20">aedict://a?q=はは%20</a> or <a href="http://aedict?q=はは">http://aedict?q=はは</a> -
clicking on those in your phone will launch Aedict which will then search for given term. '''$(bug 858)'''</li>
<li>Improved deinflector accuracy '''$(bug 857)'''</li>
<li>Improved search accuracy in exact searches '''$(bug 864)'''</li>
<li>Deinflector now handles -mashou properly '''$(bug 865)'''</li>
<li>Improved example search accuracy '''$(bug 863)'''</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.49</h2>
<p>?</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: no wa description in the inflection table '''$(bug 822)'''</li>
<li>Added: new 'words' export variable which lists buddies for given kanji or word '''$(bug 825)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: なお良い inflection crashed</li>
<li>Added: option to disable inflection recognition '''$(bug 827)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: tts now simply reads the word if there are two identical options, reading-wise '''$(bug 830)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: incorrect saseru inflection for くる '''$(bug 829)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: decrease AnkiDroid kanji font size, decrease Kanji Quiz reading font size '''$(bug 831)'''</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.48</h2>
<p>January 26th, 2018</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: Aedict crashes when OCR recognition is canceled</li>
<li>Increase Kanji Quiz Size '''$(bug 814)'''</li>
<li>Filter should be optionally disabled when not visible in the main screen '''$(bug 811)'''</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.47</h2>
<p>January 9th, 2018</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: Aedict crashes when computing Kanji parts '''$(bug 817)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: Minor crashes</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.46</h2>
<p>December 9th, 2017</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed crash when inflecting 出て来る and others</li>
<li>Fixed: Example sentences showing all occurrences of kanji when looking for single-kanji expressions '''$(bug 809)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: Example search starting with numeral returns wrong results '''$(bug 803)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: Aedict deinflects to nouns '''$(bug 701)'''</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.45</h2>
<p>October 4th, 2017</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed crash opening a v5ri verb</li>
