<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.42</h2>
<p>September 19th, 2017</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed proper kanji detection '''$(bug 791)'''</li>
<li>Fixed Kanjipad +-2 strokes now works '''$(bug 787)'''</li>
<li>Added: In kanji view, aedict should list a few similar kanjis '''$(bug 788)'''</li>
