<div style="padding-top: 46px">
<h2>3.40</h2>
<p>July 3rd, 2017</p>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: Adding a meaning/example sentence in “export to ankidroid“ results in adding it twice '''$(bug 763)'''</li>
<li>Added: ability to edit the expression field freely in AnkiDroid export '''$(bug 771)'''</li>
<li>Added: ability to deinflect continuative+causative 落ち着かせ '''$(bug 769)'''</li>
