<li>Fixed: Disable the left Navigation Menu swipe slider while doing JLPT Quizzes with the kanjipad. Can be optionally enabled back in Settings. '''$(bug 484)'''</li>
<li>Add antonym support to Aedict. '''$(bug 480)'''</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="padding-top: 46px">
