<li>Fixed: Mixed katakana/kanji cannot be found (fix available on May 1st 2015 when the new dictionary files will be uploaded). '''$(bug 474)'''</li>
<li>Fixed: Better error reporting of SDCard issues. '''$(bug 481)'''</li>
