<li>Added Expert Setting for disabling Furigana view</li>
<li>Fixed missing copy/cut buttons in TagEditor dialog. '''$(bug 445)'''</li>
<li>Kanji details: clicking on kanji would show the same activity. '''$(bug 448)'''</li>
<li>(P), (n), (exp) etc badges. '''$(bug 332)'''</li>
